<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: orbital ship crash -->
  <SpaceBattle.label>軌道星艦墜毀</SpaceBattle.label>
  <!-- EN: A massive orbital ship has suffered a catastrophic structural failure in orbit directly above your region! -->
  <SpaceBattle.description>一艘途徑此區域正上方的巨型軌道星艦產生了災難性的結構故障！</SpaceBattle.description>
  <!-- EN: The orbital ship crash is ending. -->
  <SpaceBattle.endMessage>軌道星艦墜毀結束了。</SpaceBattle.endMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: Drought -->
  <VEE_Drought.label>旱災</VEE_Drought.label>
  <!-- EN: An extreme drought has set over the area. Rain clouds have vanished, and the sun is baking the earth.\n\nOutdoor crops and wild plants will suffer heavily from the lack of moisture, almost halting their growth and eventually dying off. The fires will spread much quicker.\n\nPlants sown in hydroponics systems are not affected. -->
  <VEE_Drought.description>一場極端的旱災已開始在此區域肆虐。烈日正炙烤著大地，而雨雲卻不見蹤影。\n\n室外的作物和野生植物將因缺水而逐漸停止生長，最終難逃枯死的命運。此外，火災也將以更快的速度蔓延。\n\n種植於水耕植物盆中的植物不受影響。</VEE_Drought.description>
  <!-- EN: The drought is ending. -->
  <VEE_Drought.endMessage>旱災結束了。</VEE_Drought.endMessage>
  <!-- EN: An extreme drought has set over the area. Rain clouds have vanished, and the sun is baking the earth.\n\nOutdoor crops and wild plants will suffer heavily from the lack of moisture, almost halting their growth and eventually dying off. The fires will spread much quicker.\n\nPlants sown in hydroponics systems are not affected. -->
  <VEE_Drought.letterText>一場極端的旱災已開始在此區域肆虐。烈日正炙烤著大地，而雨雲卻不見蹤影。\n\n室外的作物和野生植物將因缺水而逐漸停止生長，最終難逃枯死的命運。此外，火災也將以更快的速度蔓延。\n\n種植於水耕植物盆中的植物不受影響。</VEE_Drought.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: psychic hum -->
  <VEE_PsychicHum.label>心靈嗡鳴</VEE_PsychicHum.label>
  <!-- EN: A weird, discordant psychic hum is vibrating through the minds of some people, seemingly chosen at random. -->
  <VEE_PsychicHum.description>一種詭異且不和諧的心靈嗡鳴正在部分人的腦海中迴盪。這些受影響者似乎是被隨機選中的。</VEE_PsychicHum.description>
  <!-- EN: The psychic hum is ending. -->
  <VEE_PsychicHum.endMessage>心靈嗡鳴結束了。</VEE_PsychicHum.endMessage>
  <!-- EN: A weird, discordant psychic hum is vibrating through the minds of some people, seemingly chosen at random.\n\nThey are unable to rest or find any relief, and their mental state is rapidly deteriorating as their exhaustion and need for recreation skyrocket.\n\nColonists affected:\n\n{0}. -->
  <VEE_PsychicHum.letterText>一種詭異且不和諧的心靈嗡鳴正在部分人的腦海中迴盪。這些受影響者似乎是被隨機選中的。\n\n受影響者將無法正常休息或緩解壓力，而隨著疲憊感和娛樂需求的激增，他們的精神狀態也會快速惡化。\n\n以下殖民者已受到影響：\n\n{0}</VEE_PsychicHum.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: psychic overdrive -->
  <VEE_PsychicOverdrive.label>心靈超頻</VEE_PsychicOverdrive.label>
  <!-- EN: A wave of psychic energy has washed over the colony, resonating specifically with the minds of some of your colonists! -->
  <VEE_PsychicOverdrive.description>一陣心靈能量波席捲了此區域，並與特定的殖民者群體產生了精神共鳴！</VEE_PsychicOverdrive.description>
  <!-- EN: The psychic overdrive is ending. -->
  <VEE_PsychicOverdrive.endMessage>心靈超頻結束了。</VEE_PsychicOverdrive.endMessage>
  <!-- EN: Every {0} colonist focuses much more on their work!\n\nA wave of psychic energy has washed over the colony, resonating specifically with the minds of some of your colonists!\n\nTheir thoughts are racing, and their bodies are moving with newfound efficiency. For the next few days, their work speed will be significantly boosted by this psychic overcharge. -->
  <VEE_PsychicOverdrive.letterText>每個{0}殖民者都會更加專注於自己的工作！\n\n一陣心靈能量波席捲了此區域，並與特定的殖民者群體產生了精神共鳴！\n\n他們的思維正飛速運轉，身體也以前所未有的的效率行動著。幾天內，心靈超頻將顯著提高他們的工作速度。</VEE_PsychicOverdrive.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: psychic stimulation -->
  <VEE_PsychicStimulation.label>心靈激悅</VEE_PsychicStimulation.label>
  <!-- EN: Some distant engine of joy sent psychic vibrations that washed over the region, specifically resonating with the minds of a particular demographic. -->
  <VEE_PsychicStimulation.description>在遙遠地區的某個東西釋放出的心靈振波席捲了此區域，並與特定的殖民者群體產生了精神共鳴！</VEE_PsychicStimulation.description>
  <!-- EN: The psychic stimulation is ending. -->
  <VEE_PsychicStimulation.endMessage>心靈激悅結束了。</VEE_PsychicStimulation.endMessage>
  <!-- EN: Every {0} colonist seems more joyful!\n\nSome distant engine of joy sent psychic vibrations that washed over the region, specifically resonating with the minds of a particular demographic. Your colonists feel a deep, soothing calm as their minds are stimulated by the ethereal energy. They are finding great relaxation in this mental state. For a few days, their recreation will be completely satisfied. -->
  <VEE_PsychicStimulation.letterText>每個{0}殖民者看起來都更加快樂了！\n\n在遙遠地區的某個東西釋放出的心靈振波席捲了此區域，並與特定的殖民者群體產生了精神共鳴！\n\n無形縹緲的能量刺激並取悅著他們的精神，使他們感受到一種深沉而又舒緩的寧靜。在這種精神狀態下，他們能獲得極大程度的放鬆。幾天內，他們的娛樂需求將被完全滿足。</VEE_PsychicStimulation.letterText>
  
</LanguageData>